WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.690
Another beautiful day!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.900
Perfect for working the fields!

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:40.120
<b>Episode 2 
A Prince Challenged Me to a Fight...</b>

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:38.560
<i>It's been a few months since my memories 
from my past life returned,</i>

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.020
<i>and taking care of the fields 
has become my hobby.</i>

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:43.990
Need any help, Sister?

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:46.100
I'll help, too, Catarina.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.620
Thanks, you two!

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.170
They're wilting...

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:55.810
But why? I've been giving 
them water and fertilizer.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:57.550
Cheer up, Sister.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.280
Here, stand u—

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.370
You don't need to worry 
about my sister, Prince Geordo.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:08.310
Also, there's no need to take 
the time to come by every day.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.650
I'm sure there's no need for you to cling 
so close to her all the time, either, Keith.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:18.490
<i>They've become such good friends.</i>

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.240
Catarina...

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.440
You've received 
an invitation to a tea party.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:29.630
Would you like to go?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.500
Tea party?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.400
She mustn't go, darling!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.590
Just look at her!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:36.420
She hasn't learned any manners at all!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.630
W-Well, that's true...

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:42.300
But perhaps she can learn 
through actual experience.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.680
Yes, I do agree, but...

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.700
I know!

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.680
Why don't we send Keith along with her?

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.060
We won't have to worry if he's with her.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.770
I'd be glad to go with her.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.910
Thank you! That'll be a big help!

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:57.730
<i>Wait... I'm the older sister.</i>

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.030
<i>Why can't I be trusted 
to go anywhere without Keith?</i>

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:08.170
Thank you for attending our tea party today.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:12.210
And thank you for inviting us.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.440
Welcome to our home.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.680
Please, make yourselves comfortable.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:17.430
Thank you.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.680
I-It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.800
I'm the fourth daughter, M-Mary Hunt.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.350
Nice to meet you, Lady Mary.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.720
Please, come inside.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.270
Oh... Of course.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.120
So you're Lady Catarina Claes?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.300
The one who's engaged to Prince Geordo?

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.130
I've heard all about you.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:52.080
It's an honor to meet you.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.240
Yes...

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.690
Lady Catarina, allow me to introduce myself!

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:56.590
Me, too!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.800
Oh, certainly.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:03.930
I'm exhausted just from greeting everyone.

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:08.470
<i>I guess they're all too busy talking to eat.</i>

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.360
<i>What a waste.</i>

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.460
<i>If I had a bag, I'd take all of these home.</i>

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:16.410
Sister?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.580
Why do you look so lost in thought?

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.890
U-Um...

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.610
Don't tell me...

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.090
you're thinking about taking 
all those desserts home.

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.650
That's incredible! How did you know?!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.330
How I knew isn't the issue here.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.580
If you do that, the dignity of 
the Claes family will come into question.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.480
Besides, you'll be in big trouble 
if Mother finds out.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.310
Didn't she just forbid you 
from eating sweets after

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.920
you ate a cookie that had fallen on

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.420
the floor, saying something
about a "3-second rule"?

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.420
Th-Then I have no other choice.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:51.820
If I can't take them home, 
I'll have to eat them all now!

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.020
Sister, please!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.450
I think you've had enough...

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:58.770
Huh?!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.550
A-Are you all right?

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.370
N-Nothing's wrong!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.050
Just going to powder my nose!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:07.740
Sister?!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.260
Glad I made it in time.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.510
I guess I ate a bit too much.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.920
L-Lady Catarina?

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.790
What brings you out here?

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.950
Oh, um... I just wanted a little fresh air.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.270
What about you, Lady Mary? 
What brings you here?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:45.640
I don't like noisy, 
crowded places very much.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.530
<i>She almost seems like she's afraid.</i>

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.340
<i>Because I have such an evil face?!</i>

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.550
Th-This garden sure is incredible.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.170
There are so many flowers. 
It's really beautiful!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.290
And they're all blooming so brilliantly.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.810
You must have a very skilled gardener.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.520
Oh, I know!

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:07.040
Hey, Lady Mary, would you 
introduce me to your gardener?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:07.800
Huh?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.510
There are some questions 
I'd like to ask

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.730
someone who can cultivate such pretty flowers!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.930
I-It's me.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:15.850
Huh?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.300
I'm the one who takes care of these flowers.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:20.930
Incredible...

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.500
How do you do it?!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.950
Do you have a secret trick?!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.940
Or is the secret in the dirt itself?!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.900
U-Um, Lady Catarina...

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.540
I'm sorry!

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.120
F-Fields?

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:36.320
You raise farm fields?

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.320
I've been raising vegetables,

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.490
but for some reason, they're wilting.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.010
I don't know why, or what I should do.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.500
I do wish I could help you,

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:48.350
but I've never raised vegetables before.

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:51.210
I can't give any advice 
after just hearing what you...

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:55.990
Then would you please come to my house 
and take a look at them?

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:56.890
Huh?!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.720
Over here, Lady Mary!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.880
You really are raising farm fields.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:05.570
I am!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.870
Look. This is what I was talking about.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.730
They do seem to be wilting.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.340
I thought it was the heat,

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:16.450
but the vegetables our gardener, 
Tom, is raising are doing fine.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.040
Maybe...

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.570
Do you have an idea?

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.370
W-Well, I can't be sure, but...

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:29.380
It may be that they aren't receiving 
enough water and fertilizer.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.640
Let's try moving them somewhere 
else and see how they do.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.180
Okay!

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.490
Look, Mary! They're doing so much better!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.040
And it's all because of you! Thank you!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.670
I-I didn't...

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.450
You have a green thumb for sure!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.870
A green thumb?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:11.510
That's what you say about people 
who have a talent for raising plants!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:16.380
Your green thumb makes you extra special 
and extra amazing, Mary!

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.810
I'm... special?

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.310
Um, Lady Catarina...

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.530
Yes?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.280
I know the vegetables are doing better now,

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:30.070
but can I still come 
and visit again sometime?

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:33.450
You're more than welcome to! 
Come visit anytime!

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:36.670
Okay!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.990
See you soon!

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:44.920
Lady Mary seems more cheerful than before.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.910
That's true. She must 
have been so afraid of me before

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.410
because I have such an evil face!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:54.310
I... I don't think that's why.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:57.520
She was acting that way toward everyone.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.860
Really?

00:08:58.860 --> 00:08:59.860
Yeah.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.680
I bet she's going through things at home

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.130
that have made her lose her confidence.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.560
Like what?

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.530
I heard at the tea party

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:11.770
that Lady Mary's mother
was Marquess Hunt's second wife,

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.980
and the rest of the family 
wasn't happy about the remarriage.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:18.600
Lady Mary's older sisters 
treated her like a nuisance,

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.970
and they've verbally 
abused her all her life.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.820
I think, after her mother passed away,

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.920
she felt like she had nowhere to belong.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.060
So that's why...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.060
But I'm sure Lady Mary is 
going to be all right now.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.730
You can tell, Keith?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.300
I suppose I can.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:42.640
Incidentally, Lady Mary's engagement 
to Prince Alan should be settled soon.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.760
Oh, really?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.770
Wait... Mary's engagement to <i>whom</i>?

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.820
Prince Alan. Prince Geordo's twin brother.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.280
<i>That's the third doom flag!</i>

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.990
We will now commence our strategy meeting.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.500
Alan is one of the conquerable 
routes in the game!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.920
Befriending the girl who's engaged to him

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:08.330
would be like walking right up 
to our own doom flag!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.080
Let's review the information we have.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:14.000
Because Alan was in poor health 
until he turned five,

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.710
he had a sheltered upbringing, 
making him spoiled and egotistical.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:21.890
Alan Stuart

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:21.890
<b>Was in poor health until age five</b>

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:21.890
He feels a deep rivalry, as well as an 
inferiority complex, toward his brother Geordo.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.890
<b>Spoiled and egotistical</b>

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.890
<b>Deep rivalry and inferiority complex
toward his brother Geordo</b>

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:24.940
But when he meets the heroine in the game,

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:26.730
his heart takes a positive turn

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:31.230
and his barely-existent relationship 
with Geordo improves.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.560
That's such a nice story!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.700
This is no time to feel moved!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.090
No need to worry.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:40.160
Catarina barely appears 
in Alan's route at all.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.520
The rival who appears in her place

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:44.970
is Alan's loving fiancée, Mary.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:50.540
Mary Hunt

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:49.630
Th-Then is Mary going to 
end up either exiled or killed?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:50.540
<b>Adores Alan from the bottom of her heart</b>

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.540
<b>Is jealous of the heroine,
however she doesn't bully her
like Catarina</b>

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:50.550
No.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.160
In the happy ending,

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.600
Mary congratulates the couple and withdraws.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.090
In the bad end, she ends up with Alan.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.840
She's a rival just like us, 
but she's such a nice character!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.720
Why is Catarina the only one 
to be treated like a monster?!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.280
What were you thinking, production staff?!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.620
You guys should try being 
in Catarina's shoes for once!

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:11.440
Order!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:16.160
We don't even know if this story 
will pan out as it did in the game.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.230
Take a look.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.820
<b>Alan</b>

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.820
<b>You have a green thumb, Mary.</b>

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.820
You have a green thumb, Mary.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.280
<b>Mary</b>

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.280
<b>A green thumb?</b>

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.280
A green thumb?

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:30.710
<b>Alan</b>

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:26.740
That's what you say about people who have a talent for raising plants.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:30.710
<b>That's what you say about people who have a talent for raising plants.</b>

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:30.710
Your green thumb makes you 
extra special and extra amazing.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.710
<b>Your green thumb makes you extra special and extra amazing.</b>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.090
Th-That sounds like what Catarina said.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:36.170
It's exactly what Catarina said, in fact.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.760
I thought I'd heard that somewhere before!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.120
Wait, does that mean we said it first?

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:44.380
A great line like that has only 
half the impact the second time!

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.190
Mary won't fall for him now!

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.920
I fear all we can do is wait 
and see what happens.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.600
Y-You're right.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.070
Alan is a beautiful prince in an otome game!

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:58.280
Having one line stolen 
from him isn't a big deal!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.860
Mary, I heard your engagement's been settled.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:03.900
Congratulations!

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.050
Thank you.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.920
I'm engaged to a prince now, too.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:12.120
I'm so happy to be in the same 
position as you, Lady Catarina.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:13.680
Right...

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.530
So, what was Prince Alan like?

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.810
He was very beautiful.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:23.360
And he praised my garden, just like you did.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.950
Really? And what happened next?

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.650
Nothing. That was all.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:32.270
Um... Your green thumb didn't come 
up in the conversation or anything?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:36.140
Lady Catarina! 
Did you actually hear about that?

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:38.910
So it did, then?! It actually came up?!

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:39.840
Yes!

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:43.980
I told Prince Alan what you told me!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.160
What?! <i>You</i> told <i>him</i>?!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.740
And you told him I said it?!

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:48.890
Yes.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:53.060
I was just so happy 
that you said such a thing to me.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.210
I couldn't help but tell him about it.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.730
<i>No way he could say it, then.</i>

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.010
<i>Not when he knew someone 
else beat him to it.</i>

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.890
<i>Sorry, Alan.</i>

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:07.330
Keep growing and make me 
some delicious veggies!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.890
My Lady!

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.040
The prince is here to visit!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.440
What are you so flustered about, Anne?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.890
Prince Geordo can just come 
right out here, like always.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:20.360
Not him! The fourth prince, Alan, is here!

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.510
What?! Why?!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.820
S-Sorry to make you wait!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.210
Took you long enough.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.960
<i>Wh-What kind of attitude is that? 
He's the one who showed up unannounced.</i>

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.320
<i>No, no. He's just a child.</i>

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:46.540
<i>Mentally, I'm seventeen plus nine years old.</i>

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.930
<i>I can't get angry at a child.</i>

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:52.170
I apologize. 
It took a bit of time to get ready.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.100
I am Catarina Claes.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.730
Alan Stuart.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.380
I need to talk to you.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:58.940
A-About what?

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.770
About Mary Hunt.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.650
Huh?

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.440
She's my fiancée now. Did you know that?

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.560
Yes, I am aware.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.200
If you're aware, then stop seducing her!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.730
S-Seducing? What do you mean?

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:14.370
Are you trying to play dumb?!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.450
I invited her over, but she refused, 
saying she had plans with you!

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.320
Lady Catarina is...

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:20.450
And when we're together, 
you're all she ever talks about!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:21.080
Lady Catarina said...

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.840
It's obvious that you're 
trying to seduce her!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.830
Lady Catarina and I...

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:26.050
Excuse me?! 
That's a blatantly false accusation!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.580
What's false about it?!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.260
You're trying to deceive 
my sweet, pure Mary!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.960
That's ridiculous!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.650
You just invited her at the wrong time,

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:35.080
and whatever you talk to her about is boring!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:35.780
What?!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.350
L-Lady Catarina!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:41.560
Any girl would accept the invitation 
of someone who appeals to her!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.830
You just have no appeal at all!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.210
No appeal?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:53.580
I've never been ridiculed 
to my face like this before.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.040
U-Um, that was just a slip of the...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.700
You've got guts, Catarina Claes.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:03.590
I accept that insult 
as a personal challenge.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.230
We will have a showdown!

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.260
Why a tree-climbing contest?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:14.940
Because Prince Alan said that since I'm 
a girl, he'd let me choose the contest.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:18.440
And this was the only thing 
I could think of that I'm good at.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.300
But I doubt that Prince Alan 
has ever climbed a tree before.

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.690
It'll be fine.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.580
Prince Alan, please don't do this.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:26.930
Keith is keeping Mother occupied so 
she won't find out, so for his sake,

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.920
If you were to get hurt...

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.400
E-Enough! Be quiet!

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.400
I'll end this quickly.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:30.520
Okay, shall we get started?

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:33.330
The first one to reach the top wins.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.750
Sure, fine.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:37.620
All right, then... take your marks.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.330
Set!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.340
Begin!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:50.140
Looks like the contest is over, Prince Alan!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.290
I-I demand a rematch!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:54.590
I'm just not used to this 
because I've never done it before!

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:57.040
<i>Hah! Don't think you can 
beat me, little rich boy.</i>

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:01.160
<i>They called me "wild monkey" 
in my past life.</i>

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.920
That's fine with me,

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:06.270
but you won't beat me that easily!

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.290
Bring it on!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:17.410
Are you all right, Prince Alan?

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.080
I-I'll win the next round!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.160
Just you wait!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.820
P-Prince Alan!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:25.920
Catarina Claes! It's time 
for another showdown!

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.070
Another showdown!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.960
Today, I will win!

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.140
Wh-What are you, a monkey?!

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:38.020
These are good, too!

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.350
Prince Alan has been coming 
here every day since.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.350
Yeah, they're not half bad.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.580
Indeed. He just doesn't want to give up.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.610
Catarina! I'm back for another...

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.360
Wh-Why are you here?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.470
This is my fiancée's house.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.320
What's so strange about my being here?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:01.110
Well, I have a showdown 
with her today, so don't butt in.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.950
You've had numerous showdowns already, 
and you haven't won even once.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.810
Don't you think it's time you gave up?

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.620
N-No.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.920
The contest hasn't been decided yet!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.010
I can do it, too! I can...

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:20.090
L-Listen, Prince Alan...

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:23.760
Why don't we pick something 
else to compete in?

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:27.080
I think my mother is about to find out 
that I've been climbing trees.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.490
If we must... What shall we compete in, then?

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.900
I know! How about piano?

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:45.940
What a surprise. I didn't 
know you could play the piano.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.440
Y-Yes...

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.290
<i>Was that supposed to be a compliment?</i>

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:52.010
It's your turn next, Prince Alan.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.810
Incredible! You're very good!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.360
It's nothing that special.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:52.210
But it really is!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:55.320
We played the same song, 
but it sounded completely different!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.120
You have remarkable talent!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.840
Catarina is right.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.810
That was truly splendid.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.850
You don't really think that.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.740
You can drop the stupid flattery!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:10.410
I know you're mocking me on the 
inside, calling me a failure!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.950
Alan...

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.950
Prince Alan!

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.520
Prince Alan.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.890
I don't have anything worth calling a talent.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.690
That's not true...

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:28.890
I can't do anything.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.820
I'm just the dregs left in Geordo's wake.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:34.420
Why do you have so little 
confidence in yourself?

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.380
I've been compared to Geordo 
since the day I was born.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.980
No matter what I do, 
I can't hold a candle to him.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.400
I've been told all my life that

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:45.450
I'm just the dregs left behind after 
Geordo took all the good qualities.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.620
How am I supposed to feel confident?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.090
I think it's more an issue of what you 
are and aren't suited for.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.250
What do you mean?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:58.250
Well... Prince Geordo has things 
he's good at and things he's bad at,

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:01.320
and I'm sure you have some of each, as well.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:04.400
We all have things we handle
well and things we don't.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.140
I've never heard of Geordo having 
anything he can't handle, though.

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:14.820
If you want to know what Prince Geordo 
can't handle, I know of something.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:15.600
Huh?

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:19.020
It happened a week ago...

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.580
He's normally so composed,

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.700
but when he saw it, he was terribly shocked.

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.460
That's clearly the thing he can't handle!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.570
What <i>was</i> it, though?

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.580
Catarina? Where are you?

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.170
Here he comes! This way!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.000
H-Hey!

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.120
The thing Prince Geordo can't handle...

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.180
is this!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.110
Prince Geordo can't stand snakes!

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:56.960
Snakes?

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:57.900
Yes!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.660
I wanted to find out for sure someday,

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:02.700
so I've kept a toy snake 
hidden in my pocket!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.870
Uh, that's not what I meant 
by "things he can't handle."

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.240
<i>I've finally found 
the perfect prince's weakness!</i>

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.780
<i>This is sure to come in handy 
when I face the threat of my doom!</i>

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:14.250
Catarina...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.760
P-Prince Geordo?

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.780
What, exactly, is this?

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.210
Um, that's...

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:25.550
Surely you wouldn't throw a thing 
like this at your fiancé, would you?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:30.720
<i>W-Wait! Am I going to be exiled for 
the crime of throwing a toy at a prince?!</i>

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:35.200
I must tell your mother about
your tree-climbing and this toy.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:36.160
Wha—

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:38.380
Anything but that! Please!

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:41.160
P-Prince Geordo!

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:24.370
I can't believe he actually 
told Mother everything.

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:25.900
<i>Still, this is great!</i>

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>I know what Geordo's weakness is now!</i>

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:31.760
When he's about to kill me, 
I'll just toss a toy snake

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.100
and run away while he's recoiling in fear!

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.580
It's the perfect plan, if I do say so myself!

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.190
Now I can avoid that doom flag!
